{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Legend** \u2014 \ud83d\udfe3 Agent judgment \u00b7 \ud83d\udd34 Deterministic enforcement \u00b7 \ud83d\udd35 External data/API \u00b7 \ud83d\udfe0 Persistent state \u00b7 \ud83d\udfe2 User-facing interface\n\nHub-and-spoke: no tool container can reach another container. Only `gateway` (live mode) or the host-side backtest harness (backtest mode) can reach a tool.",
      "color": "#868e96"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_external",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 220,
      "label": "External world (outside Docker)"
    },
    {
      "id": "ext_alpaca_api",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Alpaca Paper Trading API**\nReal broker: orders, positions,\nintraday/historical bars, news",
      "color": "#1c7ed6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ext_yfinance",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Yahoo Finance (yfinance)**\nUpstream price/technical data\nfor maverick-mcp",
      "color": "#1c7ed6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ext_googlenews",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**Google News RSS**\nnews.google.com/rss/search\nHeadlines only, live mode",
      "color": "#1c7ed6"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_docker",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 1350,
      "height": 260,
      "label": "Docker stack \u2014 isolated bridge network per tool, digest-pinned images"
    },
    {
      "id": "svc_maverick",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**maverick-mcp**\nTechnicals: RSI/MACD/\nsupport-resistance/trend +\nprice history. Point-in-time gated.",
      "color": "#1c7ed6"
    },
    {
      "id": "svc_alpaca",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**alpaca-mcp**\nLive: orders/account/positions\n(paper broker role).\nBacktest: historical news +\nintraday bars (market-data role).",
      "color": "#1c7ed6"
    },
    {
      "id": "svc_news",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**google-news-rss-mcp**\nfetch_headlines only.\nLive-mode headlines only \u2014\nnot used in backtest.",
      "color": "#1c7ed6"
    },
    {
      "id": "svc_execsim",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2170,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**execution-sim-mcp**\nBacktest-only fill simulator.\n5bps slippage, real historical\nranges. Never live execution.",
      "color": "#e03131"
    },
    {
      "id": "risk_checker",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "**risk_checker.py**\nPure, deterministic, fail-closed.\nEnforces every RULES.md numeric\nrule. A Python module -- not a\nrunning service, nothing listens\non a port for it. Mounted read-only\ninto alpaca-mcp (live) and imported\ndirectly by the harness (backtest).",
      "color": "#e03131"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_gateway",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 320,
      "label": "gateway container \u2014 Hermes harness / model boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "trading_agent",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**The trading agent** (unnamed)\nruns as an LLM call inside Hermes.\nJudgment only: reads RULES.md-gated\nevidence, proposes stop/target/qty,\nnever calls tools itself in backtest.\nLive mode: calls MCP tools directly.",
      "color": "#9c6ade"
    },
    {
      "id": "backtest_harness",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "**backtest-harness/run_backtest.py**\n(host-side, outside Docker)\nFetches everything, masks identities,\nhands the agent one prompt/cycle.\nNext-day queued execution \u2014 no\nsame-day lookahead.",
      "color": "#e03131"
    },
    {
      "id": "trade_journal",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**trade-journal-mcp**\nAll Neon reads/writes: decisions,\nexecutions, activity, insights,\nsnapshots, cycle evidence.\nFull-credential write path.",
      "color": "#f08c00"
    },
    {
      "id": "dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1870,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**dashboard**\nStatic frontend, local-only\n(127.0.0.1:8842). Reads Neon's\nData API directly \u2014 never through\ntrade-journal-mcp.",
      "color": "#2f9e44"
    },
    {
      "id": "neon",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "**Neon Postgres**\nSingle source of truth for\ndecisions/executions/activity/\ninsights/snapshots/evidence.\n`mode`+`run_id` separate backtest/live.",
      "color": "#f08c00"
    },
    {
      "id": "backtest_state",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**backtest_state.json /\ncycle_checkpoint.json**\nLocal, gitignored. Authoritative\nfor IN-PROGRESS backtest cash/\nholdings/pending orders \u2014 NOT in Neon.",
      "color": "#f08c00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note_backtest_auth",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "**Authoritative portfolio state \u2014 backtest:**\n`backtest_state.json` tracks live cash/holdings;\nNeon durably records the decision/event history\nbut is not read back as the live portfolio tracker.",
      "color": "#868e96"
    },
    {
      "id": "note_live_auth",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "**Authoritative portfolio state \u2014 live:**\nAlpaca itself is authoritative for real\npositions/orders \u2014 not the journal, which\ncan drift if a cycle broke mid-flight.",
      "color": "#868e96"
    }
  ],
